# Check 5: no hardcoded model names on SOUL.md **Model**: lines
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Workspace SOUL.md files used to hardcode the agent's model chain in
# the Identity block. On 2026-04-17 Ops claimed "Using GLM-5.1" in
# Slack one minute after the gateway had been restarted with
# sonnet-4-6 as primary — it was reading the stale SOUL.md line, not
# anything actually true. PR #112 + issue #117 sweep all 10 workspace
# SOUL.md files to a uniform directive that points at openclaw.json.
#
# This check blocks a regression: any staged SOUL.md whose **Model**:
