        confusion. If asked which model you are, either introspect
        via a tool that can check, or say you don't know without
        checking.

    Interpolate the right <agent_id> per file (design, devops, cto,
    qa, ceo, sentinel, cmo, support, finance, operations).

  WHEN BYPASSING IS OK:
    Essentially never. If you genuinely need a model name in prose
    (e.g., a historical note), put it somewhere that isn't the
